## Constructs `JsonValue.Null`.
##
## ## Retorno
## The JSON `null`.
weave null_value into JsonValue:
    return calling JsonValue.null_value

## Constructs a boolean value.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `b`: the boolean.
##
## ## Retorno
## `JsonValue.Bool`.
weave bool_val with b as bool into JsonValue:
    return calling JsonValue.bool_val with b

## Constructs an integer value.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `i`: an `i64`.
##
## ## Retorno
## `JsonValue.Int`.
weave int_val with i as i64 into JsonValue:
    return calling JsonValue.int_val with i

## Constructs a floating-point value.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `f`: an `f64`.
##
## ## Retorno
## `JsonValue.Float`.
weave float_val with f as f64 into JsonValue:
    return calling JsonValue.float_val with f

## Constructs a string value, taking ownership of `s`.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `s`: the text; ownership transfers to the returned value.
##
## ## Retorno
## `JsonValue.Str`.
weave string_val with s as string into JsonValue:
    return calling JsonValue.string_val with s

## Constructs an empty array.
##
## ## Retorno
## `JsonValue.Arr`.
weave empty_array into JsonValue:
    return calling JsonValue.empty_array

## Constructs an empty object.
